WEBVTT

01:43.978 --> 01:45.021
Get up.

01:49.109 --> 01:53.363
You may not understand language,
but you understand me, don't you?

01:56.866 --> 01:59.536
We're gonna do it.

02:00.662 --> 02:02.789
<i>He understood absolutely perfectly.</i>

02:04.124 --> 02:05.792
<i>His hair stood on end.</i>

02:06.376 --> 02:07.877
<i>He broke out in a grin.</i>

02:09.671 --> 02:12.048
<i>"Nice. This place is nice."</i>

02:13.758 --> 02:15.426
<i>The male was delighted.</i>

02:16.344 --> 02:17.804
<i>Just by staying here,</i>

02:18.721 --> 02:20.515
<i>wonderful things happen.</i>

02:22.100 --> 02:26.271
<i>And again today,
an unbelievably fantastic toy has arrived.</i>

02:27.522 --> 02:30.900
<i>It's different from that one.
And different from that one too.</i>

02:32.193 --> 02:33.903
<i>He'd never seen this type before.</i>

02:35.655 --> 02:37.073
<i>Not since he'd come here...</i>

02:41.703 --> 02:45.165
<i>had he encountered
such straightforward contact.</i>

02:49.335 --> 02:54.424
<i>It was the kind of ferocity
that brought back nostalgic memories.</i>

02:55.758 --> 02:57.051
Just as I figured.

02:58.469 --> 03:01.848
Even when you take a blow
right to the face,

03:02.557 --> 03:05.852
there's not a hint
that it's had any effect on your brain.

03:07.103 --> 03:10.398
I bet it's because
your build and toughness

03:10.481 --> 03:12.192
is equal to a water buffalo's.

03:13.193 --> 03:16.487
But what interests me even more

03:16.571 --> 03:18.823
are those canines of yours.

03:19.490 --> 03:22.243
Even after that punch of mine,
they haven't moved one iota.

03:23.203 --> 03:26.247
They're way too big
to be called "thread cutters."

03:26.873 --> 03:29.751
They're fangs. They're clearly weapons.

03:30.335 --> 03:31.961
Pickle.

03:37.091 --> 03:38.384
Let's have a bite-off.

03:39.177 --> 03:43.723
My biting power has developed so much,
I can bite a coconut to shreds.

03:44.849 --> 03:50.355
Your fangs bit through the armor
of dinosaurs in your era.

03:51.105 --> 03:53.983
Which of ours are better?

03:54.609 --> 03:56.402
<i>Though unable to understand language,</i>

03:57.153 --> 04:00.031
<i>he understood like an infant
understands its mother's heart.</i>

04:01.324 --> 04:05.620
<i>Like two lovers who approach one another
without exchanging words,</i>

04:06.996 --> 04:10.041
<i>the weapons that represent
each of their eras</i>

04:10.875 --> 04:13.211
<i>desired to clash!</i>

04:15.672 --> 04:18.549
<i>They wanted to clash. They wanted to meet.</i>

04:19.509 --> 04:20.677
<i>They wanted to join.</i>

04:21.844 --> 04:23.346
<i>I want to be with you.</i>

04:25.056 --> 04:27.058
Hi, Noble Elder.

04:27.141 --> 04:29.060
Sorry about the short notice.

04:31.312 --> 04:32.313
Really?

04:33.022 --> 04:33.856
Tomorrow?

04:34.399 --> 04:37.110
A fight at the arena?

04:40.655 --> 04:42.573
This sure is...

04:45.159 --> 04:50.331
a foolish and tardy request.

04:55.920 --> 05:02.593
Baki, why don't I tell you
where I am right now and what I'm seeing?

05:09.684 --> 05:10.935
You're kidding!

05:11.936 --> 05:16.357
Baki, you're too darn late!

05:17.859 --> 05:19.610
What's wrong, Baki?

05:25.199 --> 05:26.868
Jack!

05:35.918 --> 05:38.379
<i>How humiliating.</i>

05:39.839 --> 05:40.757
What's happened?

05:40.840 --> 05:42.342
<i>How disgraceful.</i>

06:11.871 --> 06:13.206
Jack!

06:13.706 --> 06:16.959
<i>His face has been eaten!</i>

06:38.648 --> 06:40.191
Jack...

06:40.900 --> 06:43.694
<i>He's smiling. He's definitely smiling!</i>

06:43.778 --> 06:46.406
<i>Even though his face has been torn off!</i>

06:46.489 --> 06:48.950
<i>Even though his face has been eaten,</i>

06:49.033 --> 06:51.077
<i>he hasn't given up at all!</i>

06:58.167 --> 06:59.752
Jack!

06:59.836 --> 07:02.588
<i>Whoa! Look at that!</i>

07:02.672 --> 07:05.383
<i>That's a real punch from Jack!</i>

07:05.466 --> 07:10.263
<i>It's sent even Pickle's
giant 200-kilo body flying into the air.</i>

07:10.346 --> 07:12.849
<i>Now that's a real punch from Jack!</i>

07:14.016 --> 07:15.476
<i>This feeling...</i>

07:17.937 --> 07:18.855
<i>it's not the same.</i>

07:18.938 --> 07:22.108
<i>In the past, I've punched many jaws.</i>

07:22.692 --> 07:23.985
<i>I've crushed many jaws.</i>

07:25.319 --> 07:29.615
<i>But Pickle's is totally different!</i>

07:30.199 --> 07:35.705
<i>It's as if his jaw alone weighs 200 kilos.</i>

07:36.747 --> 07:40.751
<i>In other words, even though I used
all my muscles, my bones, my breath,</i>

07:41.377 --> 07:46.048
<i>all my capabilities to their fullest
into throwing my best punch,</i>

07:47.216 --> 07:50.386
<i>I couldn't even send
a quiver through Pickle's skull.</i>

07:51.095 --> 07:54.640
<i>Pickle's brain hasn't moved one iota!</i>

07:54.724 --> 07:56.434
Jack...

07:56.517 --> 08:00.229
<i>Why didn't that strike knock him down?</i>

08:03.691 --> 08:08.237
I've been watching this fight
since before you arrived.

08:09.238 --> 08:13.409
This is no time to be amazed
at Pickle's sturdiness.

08:18.498 --> 08:21.042
Oh, that pose...

08:22.001 --> 08:24.837
Naturally, you remember.

08:25.379 --> 08:28.049
That's the fighting pose

08:28.758 --> 08:34.055
that instantly devastated
the Chinese kung fu master, Mister Retsu.

08:35.181 --> 08:39.852
The punch that Mister Jack hit him with
a moment ago has fired him up.

08:40.645 --> 08:42.688
Another way to look at it

08:43.189 --> 08:49.278
is that Mister Jack pushed Pickle
to his limit after a mere two punches.

08:50.988 --> 08:52.448
Here it comes!

09:18.432 --> 09:19.267
He's alone?

09:24.939 --> 09:29.485
Whoa! He's been flung way up there?

09:33.364 --> 09:34.740
<i>His face had been torn off.</i>

09:36.158 --> 09:39.370
<i>It was clear that the doping
was having its maximum effect.</i>

09:40.246 --> 09:44.250
<i>Though he was flung 15... No, 20 meters,</i>

09:44.750 --> 09:46.877
<i>Pickle had already started to get up.</i>

09:48.087 --> 09:49.380
<i>As he watched,</i>

09:50.423 --> 09:52.383
<i>Baki understood that he was too late.</i>

09:52.925 --> 09:55.303
<i>That understanding
transformed into realization.</i>

09:55.803 --> 09:58.472
<i>The realization transformed into pain.</i>

10:01.726 --> 10:04.145
<i>Say, boss...</i>

10:07.481 --> 10:10.901
<i>Why don't you tell me, boss?</i>

10:11.902 --> 10:16.449
<i>We modern humans, have we evolved?</i>

10:17.116 --> 10:20.202
<i>Tell me, boss!</i>

10:22.371 --> 10:23.664
<i>This is...</i>

10:26.000 --> 10:27.752
<i>This fight is...</i>

10:29.462 --> 10:33.716
<i>So, boss, are you feelin' it?</i>

10:34.383 --> 10:38.387
<i>Can you feel what I'm thinking?</i>

10:38.471 --> 10:40.598
<i>What I've lived my life for?</i>

10:42.183 --> 10:45.770
<i>Good food, good drink, women,</i>

10:46.646 --> 10:50.441
<i>money, status, glory...</i>

10:52.568 --> 10:55.071
<i>I've abandoned all those things.</i>

10:55.154 --> 10:57.615
<i>I only need one thing.</i>

11:00.910 --> 11:04.413
<i>I'm satisfied with a life lived
for just one thing.</i>

11:05.414 --> 11:07.083
<i>To be strong!</i>

11:08.668 --> 11:13.089
<i>I never quit practicing,
even to the point of incontinence.</i>

11:13.756 --> 11:17.968
<i>I took drugs until I nearly died.</i>

11:18.552 --> 11:20.721
<i>I wanted to grow large.</i>

11:21.472 --> 11:23.057
<i>Using bone lengthening,</i>

11:23.140 --> 11:27.812
<i>I obtained height
in exchange for intense pain.</i>

11:28.813 --> 11:33.275
<i>All of my biological activity
is to obtain strength.</i>

11:33.359 --> 11:36.237
<i>For this one thing I have strived for.</i>

11:36.320 --> 11:40.950
<i>And now I represent the modern age.</i>

11:41.617 --> 11:43.494
<i>So, boss...</i>

11:43.577 --> 11:44.453
<i>This...</i>

11:44.537 --> 11:45.454
<i>Fight...</i>

11:46.080 --> 11:49.208
<i>Don't you think I'm suited for it?</i>

11:52.878 --> 11:57.758
<i>Jack versus Pickle is a fight between
the cutting-edge and the most ancient.</i>

11:59.427 --> 12:03.431
<i>He came from long, long, long ago
in the Cretaceous period.</i>

12:05.099 --> 12:07.935
<i>Though the primitive man,
Pickle, had never seen a mirror,</i>

12:09.353 --> 12:13.566
<i>he quickly understood that what he had
in his hand was a part of his body.</i>

12:16.068 --> 12:17.486
<i>It was because of the pain.</i>

12:19.029 --> 12:21.157
<i>Even amidst the intense pain, he heard it.</i>

12:23.075 --> 12:24.994
<i>This is an underground arena.</i>

12:26.203 --> 12:29.915
<i>It is shut off from the noises
of the surface. It is soundless.</i>

12:31.417 --> 12:35.796
<i>In this place where not a single sound
can be heard, Pickle alone heard it.</i>

12:37.381 --> 12:39.967
<i>Not a sound,
but the soundlessness of silence.</i>

12:40.593 --> 12:41.427
<i>"Sound."</i>

12:42.595 --> 12:46.182
<i>The silence in his right ear.
The silence in his missing left ear.</i>

12:47.099 --> 12:49.143
<i>The silence in each ear was different.</i>

12:52.271 --> 12:53.439
<i>Hatred.</i>

12:54.148 --> 12:55.357
<i>Unforgivable.</i>

12:56.108 --> 12:57.443
<i>Absolutely unforgivable.</i>

12:58.736 --> 13:01.238
<i>This man who stole a part of me...</i>

13:01.322 --> 13:05.075
<i>Say, boss. We modern humans...</i>

13:06.035 --> 13:07.578
<i>He cannot be forgiven!</i>

13:08.162 --> 13:09.705
<i>Have we improved?</i>

13:10.706 --> 13:12.208
<i>Or have we deteriorated?</i>

13:14.043 --> 13:15.461
<i>What's that sound?</i>

13:18.506 --> 13:19.715
He didn't budge.

13:20.299 --> 13:22.092
<i>He dodged it at the last second.</i>

13:22.176 --> 13:25.054
<i>Has this guy developed that skill?</i>

13:26.347 --> 13:27.932
<i>This dust cloud...</i>

13:28.015 --> 13:29.725
<i>Why is there so much of it?</i>

13:30.309 --> 13:33.062
<i>That sound... Where'd that sound come from?</i>

13:33.813 --> 13:34.772
Did you see that?

13:35.272 --> 13:36.106
I saw it.

13:36.190 --> 13:42.071
Mr. Tokugawa,
do you understand what this means?

13:42.571 --> 13:43.989
<i>That sound.</i>

13:44.073 --> 13:46.742
<i>Dodging without moving a single inch.</i>

13:46.826 --> 13:48.869
<i>All this dust.</i>

13:48.953 --> 13:51.497
<i>What the hell is going on?</i>

13:51.580 --> 13:54.124
<i>I'm close! I'll definitely get him--</i>

13:57.586 --> 13:59.755
<i>There's that sound again.</i>

14:00.631 --> 14:01.507
<i>I missed!</i>

14:03.384 --> 14:04.260
<i>Whoa!</i>

14:06.929 --> 14:08.264
<i>He hasn't moved.</i>

14:08.848 --> 14:12.518
<i>I know I swept both his feet
from under him!</i>

14:12.601 --> 14:14.395
That's impossible!

14:14.478 --> 14:17.314
It appears that what we're seeing is...

14:17.857 --> 14:20.776
<i>And there's that sound again.</i>

14:26.115 --> 14:30.870
That's the move of Pickle from that era,
a move from the Cretaceous period!

14:33.247 --> 14:35.291
What the hell is that?

14:41.839 --> 14:46.260
<i>Now I get it. So, that's what it is.</i>

14:47.928 --> 14:49.680
<i>That's absolutely hilarious.</i>

14:50.681 --> 14:54.184
<i>My punches were the most powerful
and fastest possible.</i>

14:54.935 --> 14:57.855
<i>I figured Pickle
couldn't react fast enough</i>

14:57.938 --> 15:00.941
<i>and couldn't move an inch.</i>

15:01.025 --> 15:02.818
<i>Don't be stupid!</i>

15:03.402 --> 15:05.821
<i>Not only did he move more than an inch,</i>

15:06.447 --> 15:12.077
<i>he dodged the mighty blows
I let loose with energy to spare.</i>

15:12.661 --> 15:17.082
<i>What's more, he used the wall
ten meters behind him like a spring</i>

15:17.875 --> 15:21.337
<i>and returned to stand
where he started, looking smug.</i>

15:22.254 --> 15:27.927
<i>And I wasn't even able to see it happen,</i>

15:28.010 --> 15:29.595
<i>twice!</i>

15:29.678 --> 15:31.597
<i>How absolutely hilarious.</i>

15:32.890 --> 15:35.017
<i>I once heard this story.</i>

15:35.809 --> 15:41.106
<i>Let's say a human and a cat
had to fight in a cage.</i>

15:41.690 --> 15:45.361
<i>A cat has many weapons humans lack,</i>

15:46.195 --> 15:49.949
<i>like claws, fangs, reflexes.</i>

15:50.449 --> 15:55.871
<i>But most of all,
their motor coordination and speed</i>

15:56.580 --> 16:00.751
<i>are two aspects
where humans are far inferior.</i>

16:00.834 --> 16:03.837
<i>So without a weapon,
humans cannot make up the gap.</i>

16:04.964 --> 16:08.384
<i>Even if the human
is dozens of times heavier than them.</i>

16:09.218 --> 16:11.470
<i>That's what this is about!</i>

16:13.222 --> 16:17.476
<i>Meaning, Pickle moved with a speed</i>

16:17.559 --> 16:21.230
<i>that could never be matched
by those dinosaurs' reflexes.</i>

16:21.730 --> 16:23.983
<i>That's what it is!</i>

16:24.483 --> 16:27.069
<i>So fighting this guy</i>

16:27.820 --> 16:32.032
<i>is the same as being able
to defeat all those dinosaurs!</i>

16:32.741 --> 16:36.662
<i>God, for the first time,
I ask a favor from you.</i>

16:36.745 --> 16:39.999
<i>Please... please let me win--</i>

17:22.666 --> 17:24.084
It's over.

17:26.670 --> 17:28.255
He's proclaiming victory.

17:28.756 --> 17:30.591
'Cause he won.

17:41.685 --> 17:43.604
You must be kidding.

17:45.147 --> 17:47.566
A worthy opponent is a good friend.

17:48.442 --> 17:50.444
They meet, fight, and victory is decided.

17:51.445 --> 17:54.239
And as soon as it's over, they must part.

17:54.323 --> 17:57.284
Because the victor eats the loser.

17:59.453 --> 18:01.455
You've gotta be kidding.

18:01.538 --> 18:03.749
I'm the one who wants to cry.

18:03.832 --> 18:05.501
First Sea King Retsu,

18:05.584 --> 18:07.628
then Katsumi Orochi,

18:07.711 --> 18:11.381
and now Jack.

18:12.424 --> 18:16.887
They're all men I admire.

18:16.970 --> 18:22.643
Mister Tokugawa, this is no time
to be indulging in sentimentality.

18:42.162 --> 18:42.996
Baki!

19:13.527 --> 19:16.947
<i>Long ago... longer than long, long ago...</i>

19:19.158 --> 19:21.535
<i>when Pickle was still a youth,</i>

19:22.119 --> 19:26.290
<i>he was assaulted by an enemy
smaller than him for the first time.</i>

19:28.417 --> 19:32.754
<i>Eventually, he killed
the rather pesky creature.</i>

19:34.214 --> 19:38.177
<i>Pickle took apart the squashed being,</i>

19:39.178 --> 19:40.012
<i>and ate it.</i>

19:41.346 --> 19:44.099
<i>In his mouth, its honey sac burst,</i>

19:44.183 --> 19:46.393
<i>filling his mouth
with a bewitching sweetness.</i>

19:47.394 --> 19:48.687
<i>Then it happened.</i>

19:49.354 --> 19:50.189
<i>A shock.</i>

19:51.023 --> 19:53.692
<i>There was a sudden shock
that spread all over his mouth.</i>

19:54.526 --> 19:58.697
<i>This sensation felt far worse than pain.</i>

19:59.948 --> 20:02.784
<i>It was as if his mouth
was suddenly a volcano,</i>

20:03.952 --> 20:05.245
<i>spilling magma.</i>

20:06.496 --> 20:08.832
<i>Though his mouth was small,</i>

20:09.541 --> 20:12.961
<i>the scorching heat that burned inside it
was far greater in size.</i>

20:15.380 --> 20:17.341
<i>He's pretty sure he jumped all around.</i>

20:21.803 --> 20:25.057
<i>He wasn't sure when,
but he lost the ability to move.</i>

20:26.725 --> 20:28.518
<i>He engraved into his mind,</i>

20:30.270 --> 20:32.731
<i>that some things do not die
even after being killed.</i>

20:33.440 --> 20:35.484
<i>This man was clearly one of those.</i>

20:36.777 --> 20:40.739
<i>Even in that state, he was certain
this man had something left in him.</i>

20:41.990 --> 20:45.285
<i>Those were the memories
and feelings that stirred inside Pickle.</i>

20:45.869 --> 20:47.788
<i>If they were put into words,</i>

20:47.871 --> 20:49.581
<i>that is what they would be.</i>

20:50.832 --> 20:53.252
<i>Naturally, they were not words.</i>

20:53.919 --> 20:57.005
<i>Naturally, they were a momentary thought.</i>

20:58.298 --> 21:01.260
He sat down without eating him.

21:05.055 --> 21:08.308
It's obvious that he's unconscious.

21:08.392 --> 21:10.936
No matter how much of a beast Jack is,

21:11.019 --> 21:13.855
there's no way
he could fight back in this state.

21:13.939 --> 21:18.360
So, why did Pickle withdraw?

21:18.443 --> 21:20.737
What was he afraid of?

21:26.118 --> 21:27.369
What could it be?

21:27.452 --> 21:28.870
Don't!

21:47.472 --> 21:50.017
Even while he's unconscious...

21:51.143 --> 21:55.105
<i>If Pickle had continued on
and touched Jack,</i>

21:56.273 --> 21:59.985
<i>his middle fingers probably
would have pierced both of Pickle's ears</i>

22:00.485 --> 22:03.905
<i>and most likely severed his medulla.</i>

22:03.989 --> 22:07.409
If that happened,
that would've reversed the results.

22:08.076 --> 22:11.163
<i>It was a cell memory
he had engraved into himself.</i>

22:12.914 --> 22:14.207
<i>Even though unconscious,</i>

22:15.334 --> 22:20.005
<i>Jack could administer
the world's most powerful "fuck you."</i>
